{"identifier":"GoodEati1951","title":"Good Eating Habits","description":"Drama focusing on gluttony and \"hidden hunger,\" where well-nourished people eat poorly and malnourish themselves.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/GoodEati1951/GoodEati1951_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/GoodEati1951","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/GoodEati1951","durationMs":584000,"level":"A2","topic":"Nutrition;Food;Social guidance","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Good Eating Habits","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":14000,"endMs":20000,"text":"It's fun to eat supper with your family, especially when there is good food on the table."},{"startMs":21000,"endMs":22001,"text":"Fong healthy bodies."},{"startMs":23001,"endMs":25000,"text":"They are good foods to eat."},{"startMs":27000,"endMs":30000,"text":"Father is certainly enjoying his supper."},{"startMs":33000,"endMs":34000,"text":"So is Carol."},{"startMs":36001,"endMs":37001,"text":"So is Mother."},{"startMs":40000,"endMs":41001,"text":"Just look at that plate."},{"startMs":44001,"endMs":47001,"text":"Aren't you feeling well, Bill? Aren't you hungry?"},{"startMs":49000,"endMs":50001,"text":"What can be the matter?"},{"startMs":54000,"endMs":57001,"text":"After supper, it's fun to play a while before bed."},{"startMs":59000,"endMs":62000,"text":"But there's still something wrong, isn't there, Bill?"},{"startMs":63001,"endMs":66000,"text":"In a moment, you'll know what it is."},{"startMs":68001,"endMs":80000,"text":"Yes, Bill, you're getting a stomach ache."},{"startMs":83000,"endMs":86001,"text":"There it is again. Poor Bill."},{"startMs":89001,"endMs":94000,"text":"What now? We'll soon know because here comes Mother."},{"startMs":96001,"endMs":99001,"text":"Mother can tell right away that Bill isn't feeling well."},{"startMs":101001,"endMs":104000,"text":"So what happens next?"},{"startMs":105000,"endMs":108001,"text":"Yes, Bill's put to bed to get some rest."},{"startMs":111000,"endMs":113001,"text":"Now, why does Bill have a stomach ache?"},{"startMs":114001,"endMs":117000,"text":"He didn't eat anything bad today, did he?"},{"startMs":119001,"endMs":124000,"text":"Well, perhaps it wasn't what he ate, but the way he ate it."},{"startMs":125000,"endMs":127001,"text":"Why, even this morning, Mother was a little worried."},{"startMs":128001,"endMs":133001,"text":"Let's go back to this morning and see how Bill's stomach ache might have happened."},{"startMs":135000,"endMs":138000,"text":"Bill wasn't at breakfast on time this morning."},{"startMs":139000,"endMs":142001,"text":"You see, he didn't get up when Father first called him."},{"startMs":143000,"endMs":148001,"text":"Oh, Bill got to the table, and he ate his breakfast, or rather part of it."},{"startMs":149000,"endMs":152000,"text":"Orange juice, one big gulp of it."},{"startMs":153000,"endMs":155001,"text":"Milk for the cereal. Splash it on."},{"startMs":155001,"endMs":162001,"text":"No time to waste. Gobble down the cereal, a couple of big spoonfuls, one right after the other."},{"startMs":163001,"endMs":165000,"text":"But leave most of it."},{"startMs":166000,"endMs":170000,"text":"Now for the eggs. More good, healthful food."},{"startMs":170001,"endMs":172001,"text":"But what about Bill's eating habits?"},{"startMs":173001,"endMs":177001,"text":"Into his mouth went some egg. Right away, a big bite of toast."},{"startMs":178001,"endMs":182000,"text":"And there was some bacon, so he stuffed in part of that."},{"startMs":184000,"endMs":189001,"text":"And then, just one big splash of milk."},{"startMs":191000,"endMs":193000,"text":"And Bill was off to school."},{"startMs":195000,"endMs":199001,"text":"Well, he caught up with his family, and he beat them through breakfast."},{"startMs":200000,"endMs":205000,"text":"But he ate so fast. And do you think he ate enough?"},{"startMs":208001,"endMs":211001,"text":"At lunchtime, Bill had some fine sandwiches."},{"startMs":212001,"endMs":214001,"text":"He also had money to buy soup."},{"startMs":216000,"endMs":218001,"text":"But he didn't want to stand in line for soup."},{"startMs":219000,"endMs":221000,"text":"He was in a hurry to go out and play."},{"startMs":222001,"endMs":226000,"text":"So, how did Bill eat his lunch? Watch."},{"startMs":240000,"endMs":242001,"text":"After school, of course, Bill was hungry."},{"startMs":243000,"endMs":245001,"text":"He was hungry, and he had some money."},{"startMs":246000,"endMs":251001,"text":"So, but did Bill leave his pop and candy only half eaten?"},{"startMs":252001,"endMs":257000,"text":"No, sir. He emptied that pop bottle as fast as he could."},{"startMs":258000,"endMs":260000,"text":"He gobbled down all his candy."},{"startMs":263000,"endMs":267000,"text":"And, as if that wasn't enough, he ate some cookies, too."},{"startMs":268000,"endMs":270001,"text":"Then Bill didn't feel hungry anymore."},{"startMs":271000,"endMs":274000,"text":"No, sir. For once, he had eaten too much."},{"startMs":276001,"endMs":280000,"text":"At supper time, Bill still felt full."},{"startMs":281000,"endMs":285000,"text":"So, he didn't hurry with his supper. He just poked at it."},{"startMs":286001,"endMs":288000,"text":"He was tired."},{"startMs":290000,"endMs":292001,"text":"And he just didn't have any appetite."},{"startMs":294001,"endMs":297001,"text":"Bill didn't know it, but he was already beginning to be sick."},{"startMs":301000,"endMs":305000,"text":"Well, Bill, now you know what might have caused your stomach ache."},{"startMs":305001,"endMs":307001,"text":"Why you feel so bad."},{"startMs":309000,"endMs":312000,"text":"Why you'll have to stay in bed until you feel better."},{"startMs":313001,"endMs":316001,"text":"You see, you hurried so all day long."},{"startMs":317000,"endMs":321001,"text":"You rushed through your meals and didn't eat enough good food."},{"startMs":323000,"endMs":326000,"text":"And then, in the afternoon, all those sweets."},{"startMs":329000,"endMs":335000,"text":"They filled your stomach and didn't leave room for any of the foods you need."},{"startMs":337000,"endMs":341000,"text":"In fact, Bill, you mistreated your stomach all day long."},{"startMs":341001,"endMs":343000,"text":"No wonder you have a stomach ache."},{"startMs":348001,"endMs":351001,"text":"How is it this morning, Bill? Feel better?"},{"startMs":353001,"endMs":356001,"text":"Think you know now about good eating habits?"},{"startMs":362001,"endMs":364001,"text":"Downstairs in time for breakfast."},{"startMs":366001,"endMs":369000,"text":"Give yourself time to eat a good breakfast."},{"startMs":371001,"endMs":373001,"text":"Let's see how well you can eat."},{"startMs":381001,"endMs":382001,"text":"That's right."},{"startMs":383000,"endMs":385000,"text":"Drink your juice a little at a time."},{"startMs":386001,"endMs":388000,"text":"Doesn't it taste good?"},{"startMs":388001,"endMs":393001,"text":"You just never took time before to find how good food can taste."},{"startMs":395000,"endMs":397000,"text":"Mothers pleased and proud."},{"startMs":398000,"endMs":400000,"text":"We're off to a good start this morning."},{"startMs":402000,"endMs":403000,"text":"But will it last?"},{"startMs":404001,"endMs":408000,"text":"Will you remember to eat the right way?"},{"startMs":421000,"endMs":424000,"text":"Uh-oh. Almost washed your food down."},{"startMs":426000,"endMs":430000,"text":"Before you take a drink, chew your food well and swallow it."},{"startMs":431001,"endMs":433001,"text":"Now you're eating pretty well."},{"startMs":435001,"endMs":439000,"text":"Will you do as well with the bacon and eggs and toast?"},{"startMs":442001,"endMs":445001,"text":"Chew your toast thoroughly. That's the way."},{"startMs":447000,"endMs":451001,"text":"Chew and chew. Doesn't it taste extra good that way?"},{"startMs":454001,"endMs":456000,"text":"What about that bacon?"},{"startMs":458001,"endMs":462000,"text":"Well, maybe there are better ways to cut it."},{"startMs":462001,"endMs":466000,"text":"But when you eat it in small bits, you can chew it better."},{"startMs":467000,"endMs":471000,"text":"It tastes so good you want to eat every bite."},{"startMs":472001,"endMs":475000,"text":"Breakfast is more fun this way, isn't it?"},{"startMs":478000,"endMs":481001,"text":"Well, Bill, plenty of time to get to school today."},{"startMs":482000,"endMs":485001,"text":"And in class, studying seems easier."},{"startMs":487001,"endMs":489000,"text":"What? 11 o'clock?"},{"startMs":490001,"endMs":493000,"text":"Usually you're mighty hungry by this time."},{"startMs":493001,"endMs":496001,"text":"Today. Today you feel fine."},{"startMs":499001,"endMs":503000,"text":"Lunchtime is another time to practice good eating habits."},{"startMs":505000,"endMs":508000,"text":"Eat slowly and chew thoroughly."},{"startMs":510001,"endMs":513000,"text":"Finish all your food."},{"startMs":518001,"endMs":524001,"text":"Later on, drink lots of water."},{"startMs":526001,"endMs":529001,"text":"After school, that's the idea, Bill."},{"startMs":531000,"endMs":533001,"text":"A good snack of crackers and milk at home."},{"startMs":534000,"endMs":538000,"text":"That's the good kind of food if you're hungry after school."},{"startMs":541000,"endMs":544000,"text":"And then, play. Hard play."},{"startMs":545000,"endMs":549000,"text":"Plenty of pep now. Yesterday's stomach ache is forgotten."},{"startMs":553000,"endMs":558000,"text":"At supper time, you're hungry again."},{"startMs":558001,"endMs":562000,"text":"Everything tastes good, and you're eating well."},{"startMs":562000,"endMs":565000,"text":"See what good eating habits can do for you?"},{"startMs":566000,"endMs":567001,"text":"Looking for seconds."},{"startMs":573000,"endMs":575001,"text":"After supper, you feel fine."},{"startMs":577000,"endMs":580000,"text":"No stomach ache, not too tired, not hungry."},{"startMs":581000,"endMs":582000,"text":"Just feeling fine."},{"startMs":583000,"endMs":584000,"text":"And that's it."}]}